      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "Buying organic milk costs $$14.40$ per gallon. What's the unit price per quart?\n\nAssume that there are $4$ quarts in one gallon.",
      "worked_solution": "First, notice that there are $4$ quarts in $1$ gallon. So, to find the unit price per quart, we divide the total price by $4:$\n\n$$\n14.40÷4=3.60\n$$\n\nTherefore, the milk costs $$3.60$ per quart.",
